        }
      }
    },
    "Paused because %@ changes display colors. Night Shift gives warm light without a conflict." : {
      "comment" : "Panel: banner while a color app runs; the argument is its name; “Night Shift” is macOS’s own name",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
